Project note: "Dummy Surfer" is an original, independent university project.
It is inspired by the endless-runner genre at a high level only. It contains
no source code, assets, characters, audio, branding or other proprietary
material from Subway Surfers (SYBO Games) or any other commercial title.
All visuals are procedurally built from Unity primitives and all audio is
generated procedurally at runtime.
